"entity": {
"name": "Shawbrook Group Plc",
"description": "Shawbrook Group Plc engages in the provision of loans to small and medium-sized businesses and consumers in the United Kingdom. The firm operates through the following segments: Property Finance, Business Finance, Consumer Lending, and Central. The Property Finance segment provides mortgages to investors, businesses and personal customers. The Business Finance segment provides finance solutions to established businesses in the UK Small and Medium Enterprises (SME) markets, through a direct product offering. The Consumer Lending segment provides lending products enabling the delivery of unsecured loans to consumers for various purposes, including home improvements, holiday ownership, personal loans and retail finance. The Central segment includes the Group\u2019s Treasury function and Consumer Savings business which are responsible for support the lending divisions. The company was founded on April 30, 2010 and is headquartered in Brentwood, the United Kingdom.",
"rbics_econ": "Finance",
"rbics_sector": "Specialty Finance and Services",
"rbics_subsector": "Specialty Finance",
"rbics_indgrp": "Commercial Finance Services",
